<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN FIRST DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN FIRST DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the German Bundesliga after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>10 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>9 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p>8 - Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
<p>7 - Bruno Labbadia (Werder Bremen), Ulf Kirsten (Bayer</p>
<p>Leverkusen), Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen), Bernhard Winkler</p>
<p>(1860 Munich), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock)</p>
<p>6 - Harry Decheiver (Freiburg), Ion Vladoiu (Cologne), Krasimir Balakov (VfB Stuttgart)</p>
